Description:
[b][i]HELLO WORLD[/i][/b]! I randomly decided a few days ago that I’d love to make a lil update to this mod, since there’s a few people who like those funky silly guys and I had some time and motivation to go back to Stadew. :]
<br />[b]SO WHAT’S NEW???[/b]:
<br />[list]
<br />[*]First and foremost, I changed up the location of where they live. [u]The seasons and weather will change now[/u], I never really thought of how annoying it is to walk into a spring map while the rest of the game is already in winter… Lol. So that’s that!
<br />[*]Another change I’ve done is [b][u]HEART EVENTS[/u][/b] for all the characters. Most of the events have very few conditions that need to be met to get triggered, so you will most likely stumble upon them whether you like it or not (as long as you keep growing your hearts with the characters…).
<br />[*]I added a [u][b]Jordan’s seed shop[/b][/u] function for anyone who’s a cheap little rat like me and wants to buy seeds for an extremely cheap price. You will be able to find all possible vanilla seed types for each season there, including the flowers, and he sells tree saplings in winter as well. ^^
<br />[*]I edited some of their looks… Hope you guys like it that way better than the previous designs!
<br />[*]I also changed the house map, because it was a bit ugly previously. Now it has functioning door, the store, and the area is generally more decorated.
<br />[/list]-------------
<br />This mod adds 6 new NPCs, who are roommates and close friends. Each of them have unique looks and personality, and they were made in the process of my journey of learning how to mod Stardew. They are all datable characters! (There could be a girl version made in the future). Although it was not strictly coded for the version 1.6, it was tested in it, and it works, so it's compatible.
<br />-------------
<br />NEW LOCATIONS:
<br />- West Woods, which is the area where the mod buildings are added. It can be accessible through a warp space created in the left upper corner of the Forest. (I will attach a picture showing where exactly the warp is located.
<br />- Yellow House, which is the house where Aubrey, Jordan, Kyle and Eden live. In the future updates the layout of the house might change because I'm cringing a little bit at the way the kitchen looks lol.
<br />- Victor's Lab, which is where Victor lives, and spends most of his time in. Unless he's at the Saloon, you will find him there.
<br />- Kenny's Tent, which is where Kenny lives. Don't question why his roommates kicked him out of the house and made him sleep in a tent.
<br />-------------
<br />NEW NPCS:
<br />- Aubrey: a fashion designer who can get a little cocky at times, but he turns out to be a very kind and generous person the more you talk to him. He may or may not have a darker past that's connected to Victor.
<br />- Jordan: a polite and sweet farmer, who has lived in Pelican Town ever since he was a kid. He's kind of the glue that holds his friends together, and the house everyone lives in once belonged to his parents. He may or may not be struggling with seasonal emotional swings.
<br />- Kyle: an alternative guy who can be really rude at times. He doesn't like change so he's not a person who's easy to befriend, but once you do, you might be able to see his softer side. He may or may not hate living in Pelican Town and only moved there in the first place because of his best friend Eden.
<br />- Eden: an introverted guy who's very interested in painting. He can be kind of shy and insecure, so it will take some effort to befriend him, but he is really sweet once you two are close. He may or may not be venting to you every two seconds about his art block and constantly seeking validation from you and everyone around.
<br />- Kenny: he's crazy, but cute. Kenny is a character that isn't supposed to be easily understood, or make a lot of sense, for that matter. He's supposed to be unpredictable and entertaining in a way, because you'll never know his next move. He may or may not be secretly friends with the cave monsters.
<br />- Victor: a scientist who's also a workaholic. Victor is generally mean, unless you get on his good side, which is not an easy task. He may or may not have moved to Pelican Town to run away from his criminal past...
<br />-------------
<br />SCHEDULES, so that you don't have to struggle:
<br />- Aubrey:
<br />: ̗̀➛ Monday: he stays home until 4 PM, then he leaves to meet up with Elliot at his cabin, at around 7 PM he leaves the cabin and hangs out at the beach for the rest of the day;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Tuesday: he stays home until 12 PM, then he leaves to Pierre's store to buy groceries and stays there until 6 PM, then he goes back home;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Wednesday: he stays home until 1 PM, then goes to hang out with Victor at his Lab, stays there until 5 PM, then he hangs out in West Woods, then at 8 PM goes back inside the house;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Thursday: he stays home until 12 PM, then goes to the Beach, and at 3 PM he goes back home and spends the rest of his day there;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Friday: he stays home until 12 PM, then goes to the Beach, at 3 PM he makes his way to the Saloon, and goes back home at 9 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Saturday: he stays home until 12 PM, then he leaves to Pierre's store to buy groceries and stays there until 6 PM, then he goes back home;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Sunday: he stays home until 1 PM, then goes to hang out with Victor at his Lab, stays there until 5 PM, then he hangs out in West Woods, then at 8 PM goes back inside the house;
<br />
<br />- Jordan: 
<br />: ̗̀➛ Monday: he leaves his house at 9 AM, and goes to hang out at the Town. He stays there for the whole day;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Tuesday: he stays home until 10 AM, then goes to Pierre's store, at 1 PM he makes his way to the Beach, at 5 PM he goes to hang out in the Town, and at 9 PM he goes back home;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Wednesday: he stays home until 9 AM, then goes to hang out in front of his house, at 1 PM he goes to hang out at the Forest, and at 7 PM he makes his way to the Town;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Thursday: he leaves his house at 9 AM, and goes to hang out at the Town. He stays there for the whole day;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Friday: the only time he leaves the house is to go to the Saloon at 3 PM, and he stays there until 9 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Saturday: he stays home until 10 AM, then goes to Pierre's store, at 1 PM he makes his way to the Beach, at 5 PM he goes to hang out in the Town, and at 9 PM he goes back home;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Sunday: he leaves his house at 9 AM, and goes to hang out at the Town. He stays there for the whole day;
<br />
<br />- Kyle:
<br />: ̗̀➛ Monday: he hangs around the house with Eden until 7 PM, then they both go to the Forest, and come back home at 10 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Tuesday: he stays at the house until 3 PM, then he goes to hang out at the Town, and at 8 PM comes back home;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Wednesday: he hangs around the house with Eden until 7 PM, then they both go to the Forest, and come back home at 10 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Thursday: he stays home until 2 PM, then goes to the Railroad to hang out with Sebastian, then goes back home at around 7 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Friday: he stays home until 11 AM, because he leaves to hang out at the Beach, then goes to the Saloon at 3 PM and goes back home at 9 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Saturday: he hangs around the house with Eden until 7 PM, then they both go to the Forest, and come back home at 10 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Sunday: he stays home until 8 AM, then goes to hang out at the Town, at 12 PM he goes to hang out at the Beach, and come back home at around 7 PM;
<br />
<br />- Eden:
<br />: ̗̀➛ Monday: he hangs around the house with Kyle until 7 PM, then they both go to the Forest, and come back home at 10 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Tuesday: he stays home until 4 PM, then goes to hang out at the Town, he comes back at 9 PM and stands in front of the house;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Wednesday: he hangs around the house with Kyle until 7 PM, then they both go to the Forest, and come back home at 10 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Thursday: he leaves the house at 9 AM to go to the beach, and stays there until 7 PM, then goes to Willy, and at 10 PM he goes back home;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Friday: he stays home until 3 PM, because he goes to the Saloon, he comes back home at 10 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Saturday: he hangs around the house with Kyle until 7 PM, then they both go to the Forest, and come back home at 10 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Sunday: he leaves the house at 9 AM to go to the beach, and stays there until 7 PM, then goes to Willy, and at 10 PM he goes back home;
<br />
<br />- Kenny: 
<br />: ̗̀➛ Monday: at 9 AM he leaves his tent to hang out in the area, at 12 PM he goes to hang out at the house, at 4 PM he decides to go bother Victor, at 7 PM he leaves to the Forest, and comes back home at 10 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Tuesday: he leaves his tent at 9 AM to go to the Town, then at 2 PM he starts hanging out at the Forest, he goes back home at 9 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Wednesday: he leaves his tent at 9 AM to go to the Beach, then at 2 PM he starts hanging out at the Forest, he goes back home at 9 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Thursday: he hangs around his tent, only leaves it at 1 PM to hang out with Victor, but then comes back at around 4 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Friday: he stays in West Woods until 1 PM, because he leaves to meet Harvey at the Hospital, then at 3 PM he goes to the Saloon, then comes back home at 9 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Saturday: he leaves his tent at 9 AM to go to the Town, then at 2 PM he starts hanging out at the Forest, he goes back home at 9 PM;
<br />: ̗̀➛ Sunday: he stays in the tent until 9 PM, because then he leaves to hang out outside the tent;
<br />
<br />- Victor:
<br />: ̗̀➛ he will always be in his lab, besides for Friday, when he leaves to the Saloon at 3 PM and goes back to his lab at 9 PM;
